  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\nS(x)= & (1+x)+2(1+x)^2+3(1+x)^3+. .+60(1+x)^{60} \\\\\n(1+x) S= & (1+x)^2+\\ldots \\ldots . \\quad 59(1+x)^{60}+60(1+x)^{61} \\\\\n& -x S=\\frac{(1+x)(1+x)^{60}-1}{x}-60(1+x)^{61}\n\\end{aligned}$<br />Put $\\mathrm{x}=60$\n$-60 \\mathrm{~S}=\\frac{61\\left((61)^{60}-1\\right)}{60}-60(61)^{61}$\non solving 3660",
